# A GitHub App private key IS the App: whoever holds it can act as it on every
# repository the App is installed on. One landed at the repository root during setup,
# untracked but not ignored — a single `git add -A` from being public. The key itself
# belongs outside the repository (`~/.config/test-framework-v2/github-app.pem`); this
# is the net under that, not the plan.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.log
.DS_Store
